  "name": "Sardine, Anchovy, Mackerels Egg Production in the Japanese Pacific EEZ",
  "description": "Data includes annual egg production of small pelagic fishes along the Pacific coast of Japan. [ Reference: PICES Scientific Report No. 18 2001, Proceedings of the PICES/CoML/IPRC Workshop on \"Impact of Climate Variability on Observation and Prediction of Ecosystem and Biodiversity Changes in the North Pacific\", http://www.pices.int/publications/scientific_reports/Report18/default.aspx. ]\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To index catch and stock abundance.",
